      "updated": 1788193001165,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- homegrown solutions - bash script magic, etc.\n- docker-compose - having a bunch of containers start that handle this.\n    - you have to learn a bunch of non .net stuff for this.\n- Aspire - Microsoft's \"new-ish\" solution for doing this kind of thing*.\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- homegrown solutions - bash script magic, etc.\n- docker-compose - having a bunch of containers start that handle this.\n    - you have to learn a bunch of non .net stuff for this.\n- Aspire - Microsoft's \"new-ish\" solution for doing this kind of thing*.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "JrxbyKGesQQge7zX8jHgj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -144,
